 "strategy": "if you dont know how to flip quick, see my previous CCT deck.\n\nsome card strategy:\n\nDesilijic tattoo: makes bounty hunters, especially ones with weapons, good\n\njabbas influence: makes BHs more powerful and lets you deploy non-BHs from reserve. also lets Palpy be used with Scum\n\nket maliss: can deploy DBs, can take some good people, and while Palpy's not on table, makes black sun agents(some of which are \"created\" with Xizor) better\n\nspecial delivery: can deploy effects and makes use of Carbonite Chamber Counsle\n\none of my favorite combos is Jodo Kast, a naboo blaster rifle, some other random alien, hidden weapons, and Jabba's Through With You. almost garunteed hit on anyone, two battle destinies and (hopefully)a hidden weapons capture/hit/lost",
